Package: faf
Title: Fire-Adapted Forests Carbon Accounting (Verra M0159)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Katharyn", "Duffy", , "katharyn@vibrantplanet.net",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
Description: Reference implementation of the equations in the Verra
    "Improved Forest Management for Fire-Adapted Forests" methodology
    (M0159). Functions reproduce the methodology's annual, pixel-level
    carbon accounting -- live aboveground carbon (LAG) and dead wood
    (DW) change, fire and treatment emissions, dead-wood propagation,
    uncertainty deduction, and crediting -- so that reviewers can run
    the accounting logic on sample data and confirm it is conservative
    and internally consistent. A Quarto worked example renders the
    equations end to end on illustrative inputs.
